cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these tables, please cite the repository as below."
type: software
title: "Newly exposed Caspian seabed along Azerbaijan's coast, 2017-2026: code and data"
abstract: >-
  Google Earth Engine and Python code, input tables and results for a yearly map of the
  seabed exposed by the falling Caspian Sea along the coast of Azerbaijan from 2017 to
  2026, its link to sea level, the vegetation that follows, and the protected areas and
  population next to it.
